---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
const description = 'Practice Packet publishes free, single-skill math worksheets for kindergarten through grade 5.'
---
<Base title="About Practice Packet" description={description} path="/about/">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">Practice Packet is a free worksheet site for families and teachers. The pages are written and checked by the Practice Packet team.</p>
  <p>Each math page is one skill. You get a short explanation, one worked example, and three levels: easy, medium, and hard. The answer key is built from the same problems as the worksheet. Nothing on the free page asks you to log in.</p>
  <p>A “new numbers” button builds another set on the screen without changing the address. The PDF download stays the original set, so a link you saved still prints the same page.</p>
  <p>Reading, writing, and science are part of the site plan and are not published yet. Empty sections are left off the menu on purpose.</p>
  <p>Questions go to <a href="mailto:contact@practicepacket.com">contact@practicepacket.com</a>.</p>
</Base>
